  {
   "id": "botany-manor-225426@1.0.2",
   "gameId": "botany-manor-225426",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-04-13T21:06:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey botanists! We’re so happy to see you all enjoying Botany Manor!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all for communicating and reporting issues, we have fixed up a bunch and listed them below. Please understand we are a very small team and are still addressing other issues, which will roll out in due time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Full list of fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "* Replaced ‘move up’ with ‘move down’ on the tower lever.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Added a collider to the kitchen wall so the interaction dots of the scale weights don’t see through.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Some localisation fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Make sure saving doesn’t happen while sitting down, causing a potential locked player state on resuming the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fix a typo in the letter from Arabella’s sister in the Flower Room.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fix a typo on the squirrel card in the Boat House.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Make sure the letter lock is correctly localised in Traditional and Simplified Chinese at the start of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Trigger the plant growth achievement after growing a plant, so players with missing achievements can trigger it even after completing the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Added a chapter select to main menu, so you can easily restart/replay a chapter. This should help currently soft-locked players while we work on more fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fix an issue where the Formal Garden key would be missing when resuming the game, if it was not picked up in previous session.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
